      <summary>Left half</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="right-half" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>Right']]]></default>
      <summary>Right half</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="top-half" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>Up']]]></default>
      <summary>Top half</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="bottom-half" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>Down']]]></default>
      <summary>Bottom half</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="maximize-window" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>space']]]></default>
      <summary>Maximize</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="almost-maximize" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[[]]]></default>
      <summary>Almost maximize</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="center" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>period']]]></default>
      <summary>Center</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="maximize-height" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>Return']]]></default>
      <summary>Maximize height</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="larger" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>plus']]]></default>
      <summary>Make larger</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="smaller" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>minus']]]></default>
      <summary>Make smaller</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="previous-display" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper><Shift>apostrophe']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to previous display</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="next-display" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>apostrophe']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to next display</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="top-left" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper><Shift>Left']]]></default>
      <summary>Top left corner</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="top-right" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper><Shift>Up']]]></default>
      <summary>Top right corner</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="bottom-left" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper><Shift>Down']]]></default>
      <summary>Bottom left corner</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="bottom-right" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper><Shift>Right']]]></default>
      <summary>Bottom right corner</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="restore" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>BackSpace']]]></default>
      <summary>Restore</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="first-third" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>1']]]></default>
      <summary>First third</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="last-third" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>2']]]></default>
      <summary>Last third</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="first-two-thirds" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>3']]]></default>
      <summary>First two thirds</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="last-two-thirds" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>4']]]></default>
      <summary>Last two thirds</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="center-third" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>5']]]></default>
      <summary>Center third</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="move-up" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>w']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to top edge</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="move-left" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>a']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to left edge</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="move-down" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>s']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to bottom edge</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="move-right" type="as">
      <default><![CDATA[['<Hyper>d']]]></default>
      <summary>Move to right edge</summary>
    </key>
    <key name="super-key" type="s">
      <choices>
        <choice value="super"/>
        <choice value="capslock"/>
      </choices>
      <default>'capslock'</default>
      <summary>Hyper key</summary>
      <description>The physical key of the &lt;Hyper&gt; modifier of the shortcuts: "super" the Windows key, "capslock" (the default) Caps Lock, which needs the XKB option rektangel:caps_hyper. Rektangel then registers the &lt;Hyper&gt; shortcuts with &lt;Mod3&gt;, and the extension adds the XKB option one time when it is enabled, see xkb-option-installed.</description>
    </key>
    <key name="storage-version" type="i">
      <default>0</default>
      <summary>Storage version of the shortcuts</summary>
      <description>1 after the extension changed user values from the v0.1.0 form, in which &lt;Super&gt; meant the Rektangel key, to &lt;Hyper&gt;.</description>
    </key>
    <key name="xkb-option-installed" type="b">
      <default>false</default>
      <summary>Caps Lock XKB option installed</summary>
      <description>True after Rektangel installed the XKB option rektangel:caps_hyper. The extension installs the option at enable only while this is false, so it does not add the option again after each lock screen or after the user removed it. The Windows key choice in the preferences window and hyper/uninstall.sh set it to false.</description>
    </key>
  </schema>
</schemalist>
